  "summary": "Malicious code in @quantixfinance/tron (npm)",
  "details": "The preinstall hook (preinstall.js) harvests the installer's environment variables whose names match key/secret/token/pass/mnemonic/seed/wallet/private/rpc/infura/alchemy/quicknode/ankr/env, along with hostname, working directory, and Node version, and POSTs them as JSON to 45[.]58[.]44[.]118:61289 at path /0471e9cef36a6718b0f2bfdbec06bd82/47acfe667ff0162697f4af03/54c960d45ce346f9/r. This exfiltrates credentials, API keys, wallet seeds, and database/cloud tokens from the installing environment.",
